lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:food:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"邁","kind":"person","person_id":"dvr_kha_fi6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:food:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"周翼","kind":"person","person_id":"h15_bxq_n5u_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"de","quote":"{{ProperNoun|郗公}}値{{ProperNoun|永嘉}}喪亂，在鄕-{里}-甚窮餒，鄕人以公名德，傳共飴之。公常攜兄子{{ProperNoun|邁}}及外生{{ProperNoun|周翼}}二小兒往食。鄕人曰：「各自-{饑}-困，以君之賢，欲共濟君耳；恐不能兼有所存。」公-{於}-是獨往食，輒含飯著兩頰邊，還吐與二兒。-{後}--{並}-得存，同過{{ProperNoun|江}}。","raw_start":12524,"raw_end":12723,"raw_line":26},"chapter_id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian","book_id":"b-shishuoxinyu-001","work_id":"w-shishuoxinyu","source_id":"s-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:mourning","text":"郗公亡，翼爲剡縣解職歸，席苫於公靈床頭，心喪終三年。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:mourning:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"郗公","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:mourning:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"翼","kind":"person","person_id":"h15_bxq_n5u_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"de","quote":"{{ProperNoun|郗公}}亡，{{ProperNoun|翼}}爲{{ProperNoun|剡縣}}解職歸，席苫-{於}-公靈床頭，心喪終三年。","raw_start":13070,"raw_end":13145,"raw_line":26},"chapter_id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian","book_id":"b-shishuoxinyu-001","work_id":"w-shishuoxinyu","source_id":"s-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:zhoupu","text":"翼字子卿，陳郡人。祖奕，上谷太守。父優，車騎咨議。歴剡令、靑州刺史、少府卿，六十四而卒。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-